      "id": "claim_ee7c3edc3bba4002ab8cc5ec2a459bd9",
      "statement": "A local override catalog is consulted only on a primary genai-prices miss: the user's ~/.deepagents/prices.json first, then the maintainer-curated bundled_prices.json; upstream always wins and on a conflicting (provider id, model id) pair the user file wins over the bundled one.",
