      "id": "claim_9566b246706e4d6399bbc1ea95be7b17",
      "statement": "record_message_usage counts one API call once regardless of chunking: a completed AIMessage is idempotent on replay while a later chunk revises the request already recorded (via retract_request against the exact RecordedRequest ledger entry), so per-model and per-kind breakdowns cannot drift from the totals.",
